\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e世界任务：\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"969\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/13/76078930/5f9af9d051379276e4fc7f76ed7d9bcb_839794851259838928.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"古云有「螭」\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/969/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/969/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e古云有「螭」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"3882","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"NPC对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\",\"child_ids\":{\"0z9n8m88a1jT1746625024765\":[],\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":[\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\"],\"a5moq4lt17eT1746624975423\":[],\"gcgp5jr441aT1746625025748\":[],\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":[\"a5moq4lt17eT1746624975423\",\"tdq9k7vrwyT1746625023730\",\"0z9n8m88a1jT1746625024765\",\"gcgp5jr441aT1746625025748\"],\"tdq9k7vrwyT1746625023730\":[]},\"contents\":{\"0z9n8m88a1jT1746625024765\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e是啊，我儿子和儿媳都在外面闯生活，就我和孙子孙女留在村子里。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e唉，要是多个帮手的话，下田的时候这铺子就能继续开着了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【店里就你一个人吗？】\"},\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【】\"},\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【白天】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"\"},\"a5moq4lt17eT1746624975423\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e坐下歇歇脚吧，来尝尝我们轻策庄的茶水。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/05/07/50494840/11ee64c710e3b091256c0d349ac55461_7035099274480015880.png\",\"option\":\"【您这里卖什么？】——打开商店界面\"},\"gcgp5jr441aT1746625025748\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e这就要走了吗？好吧，路上小心。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【再见。】\"},\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e是来喝茶的吧，快坐快坐，这边请。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\"},\"tdq9k7vrwyT1746625023730\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e看大家每天做农活没个歇息的地方，我就支了这么一个铺子，方便方便老友和过路人。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e只不过你也看到了，生意不太好，哈哈。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e但每次有人来我这儿点碗茶聊两句的时候，我就觉得，果然开这么个铺子是值得的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【关于茶铺。】\"},\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【】\"}}}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"3885","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_te